('72BC5Za','Archer Pull-Up','back','latissimus dorsi',array['biceps','forearms'],'bodyweight',array['Begin by hanging from a pull-up bar with palms facing down, just beyond shoulder width.','Brace your trunk and pull your shoulder blades down and back.','Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.','Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.','Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.','Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.'],0),
