('76vfTdU','Dumbbell Step Up Single Leg Balance with Biceps Curl','upper arms','biceps',array['quadriceps','glutes','hamstrings'],'dumbbell',array['Take your place in front of a step or platform with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing your body.','Set your right foot on the step, ensuring your entire foot is in contact with the surface.','Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.','Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.','Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.','Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.'],0),
