('7Ba7bQ2','Kettlebell Two-Arm Clean','shoulders','deltoids',array['trapezius','forearms'],'kettlebell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a kettlebell ahead of your thighs with both hands, palms facing toward you.','Bend your knees slightly and hinge at the hips, lowering the kettlebell toward the ground.','Brace before the pull and keep the load close to the body.','Drive through the legs and hips, then guide the weight to its receiving position.','Receive the load with the torso braced and feet stable.','Stand tall to finish, then lower the weight under control before the next rep.'],0),
