('8d8qJQI','Barbell Reverse-Grip Incline Bench Row','back','upper back',array['biceps','forearms'],'barbell',array['Angle the bench to roughly 45 degrees.','Take a seat on the bench facing the backrest with your chest against it.','Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.','Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.','Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.','Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.'],0),
