('aumB2IV','Assisted Sit-Up','waist','abdominals',array['hip flexors'],'assisted',array['Sit at the bench edge, or ask a partner to secure your feet.','Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.','Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.','Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.','Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.','Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.'],0),
