('BgljGjd','Machine Reverse T-Bar Row','back','upper back',array['biceps','forearms'],'leverage machine',array['Set the seat height and footplate position on the leverage machine.','Take a seat on the machine with your chest against the pad and your feet flat on the footplate.','Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.','Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.','Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.','Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.'],0),
