('Dsfz0Id','Ez-Bar Seated Close-Grip Concentration Curl','upper arms','biceps',array['forearms'],'EZ bar',array['Plant both feet while seated on a bench; hold an EZ barbell with palms facing up.','Set your elbow on the inside of your thigh, just above the knee.','Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.','Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.','Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.','Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.'],0),
('DsgkuIt','Dumbbell Lateral Raise','shoulders','deltoids',array['trapezius'],'dumbbell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing your body.','Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position and Brace your trunk.','Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.','Raise the arms out to the sides to about shoulder height without leaning or shrugging.','Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.','Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.'],40),
