('ErqK3UL','Posterior Step to Overhead Reach','waist','abdominals',array['glutes','hamstrings','quadriceps','deltoids'],'bodyweight',array['Stand and set your feet about hip width and your arms by your sides.','Step back with your right foot, landing on the ball of your foot.','Set your stance wide enough to balance before bending either knee.','Step back into a lunge while reaching both arms overhead, then drive forward to stand.','Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.','Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.'],0),
