('euI1BwR','Barbell Speed Squat','upper legs','glutes',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves'],'barbell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, toes slightly turned out.','Rest the bar across the upper back and take a secure grip.','Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.','Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.','Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.','Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.'],0),
('euq4pwp','Band Standing Twisting Crunch','waist','abdominals',array['obliques'],'resistance band',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and place the band around your upper back, crossing it ahead of your chest.','Take hold of the ends of the band with your hands, keeping your elbows bent and close to your sides.','Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.','Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.','Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.','Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.'],0),
