('G8dXpNG','Ez-Bar Reverse-Grip Bent Over Row','back','upper back',array['biceps','forearms'],'EZ bar',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and knees soft.','Take hold of the ez barbell with palms facing up, and hands about shoulder width.','Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.','Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.','Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.','Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.'],0),
('g9AsZ8P','Kettlebell Single-Arm Row','back','upper back',array['biceps','forearms'],'kettlebell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a kettlebell in one hand with palms facing down.','Bend your knees slightly and hinge forward at the hips, with your spine steady and your core engaged.','Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.','Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.','Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.','Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
('GaSzzuh','Back Lever','back','upper back',array['biceps','forearms','core'],'bodyweight',array['Begin by hanging from a pull-up bar with palms facing down, hands just beyond shoulder width.','Brace your trunk and pull your shoulder blades down and back.','Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.','Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.','Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.','Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.'],0),
('gAwDzB3','Cable Triceps Pushdown (V-Bar)','upper arms','triceps',array['forearms'],'cable',array['Connect a v-bar attachment to the cable machine at the highest setting.','Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Stand far enough from the stack for the cable to stay taut.','Keep your elbows near your ribs and straighten your arms against the cable.','Keep the elbows close to the body instead of letting the shoulders swing.','Return along the same path at a controlled pace.'],0),
('Gchi5Tr','Cable Alternate Triceps Extension','upper arms','triceps',array['deltoids'],'cable',array['Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Take hold of the cable handle with your right hand and bring your arm up so that your upper arm is parallel to the ground and your elbow is bent at a 90-degree angle.','Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.','Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.','Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.','Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
('GdMa1ET','Incline Scapula Push Up','chest','serratus anterior',array['triceps','deltoids'],'bodyweight',array['Angle the bench to roughly 45 degrees.','Set your hands on the bench just beyond shoulder width.','Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.','Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.','Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.','Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.'],0),
('gEyURal','Barbell Single Leg Deadlift','upper legs','glutes',array['hamstrings','erector spinae'],'barbell',array['Stand and set your feet about hip width, holding a barbell ahead of your thighs with palms facing down.','Transfer your weight onto your left foot and lift your right foot slightly off the ground.','Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.','Push the hips back while keeping the load close and the spine steady.','Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.','Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.'],0),
('gf3ZjB9','Sled Closer Hack Squat','upper legs','glutes',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves'],'sled machine',array['Set the sled machine to a comfortable weight and position yourself with your back against the pad.','Set your feet about shoulder width on the platform, toes slightly pointed outwards.','Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.','Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.','Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.','Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.'],0),
