('gFyFj9z','Dumbbell Step-Up Lunge','upper legs','quadriceps',array['glutes','hamstrings','calves'],'dumbbell',array['Take your place in front of a step or platform with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing your sides.','Set your right foot on the step, ensuring your entire foot is on the surface.','Put the lead foot fully on the platform before shifting your weight onto it.','Step onto the platform and drive through the lead foot to stand tall on it.','Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.','Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.'],0),
