('HBYyX94','Barbell Split Squat','upper legs','quadriceps',array['glutes','hamstrings','calves'],'barbell',array['Begin by standing with your feet about shoulder width, holding a barbell across your upper back.','Step far forward with your right foot, keeping your torso upright.','Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.','Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.','Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.','Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.'],0),
