('HtfCpfi','Star Jump','cardio','cardiovascular system',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves'],'bodyweight',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your arms by your sides.','Before moving, bend your knees slightly and jump up explosively.','Bend the hips and knees slightly to load the jump.','Load the legs with a small bend, then drive through the floor and land softly.','Land with bent hips and knees and let the feet absorb the impact.','Absorb the landing through the hips and knees before repeating.'],0),
