('hvHhCv8','Cable Forward Raise','shoulders','deltoids',array['triceps','forearms'],'cable',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your knees soft.','Take hold of the cable handle with palms facing down, and your arms straight in front of you.','Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.','Lift the arms forward to about shoulder height, keeping the ribs down and torso still.','Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.','Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.'],0),
