('i11JWU7','Cable Standing Reverse-Grip Single-Arm Overhead Triceps Extension','upper arms','triceps',array['deltoids'],'cable',array['Face the away from the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Take hold of the cable handle with palms facing up and extend your arm overhead, keeping your elbow close to your head.','Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.','Keep the upper arms pointed upward and extend at the elbows without flaring the ribs.','Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.','Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
