('i6LWjok','Barbell Pullover','back','latissimus dorsi',array['pectorals','triceps'],'barbell',array['Settle onto a bench with your head at one end and your feet on the floor.','Take a barbell with a shoulder-width grip and extend your arms straight above your chest.','Set the ribs down and keep a small elbow bend before lowering the weight.','Lower the weight in an arc behind your head until you feel a comfortable shoulder stretch.','Keep the ribs down as the arms travel overhead.','Pull the weight back over the chest along the same arc, without lifting the ribs.'],0),
