('Ia7tumC','Dumbbell Seated Single-Leg Calf Raise','lower legs','calves',array['hamstrings','glutes'],'dumbbell',array['Take a seat on a bench or chair with your feet planted and a dumbbell resting on your right thigh.','Reach your left leg straight out in front of you, keeping your foot flexed.','Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.','Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.','Keep the pelvis level as the supporting leg does the work.','Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
