('j7XMAyn','Cable Upper Chest Crossovers','chest','pectorals',array['deltoids','triceps'],'cable',array['Connect the handles to the cables at chest height.','Take your place in the center of the cable machine with one foot slightly in front of the other.','Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.','Bring the handles across the front of your chest in a broad arc, keeping a slight elbow bend.','Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.','Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.'],0),
('j9Q5crt','Walking on Stepmill','cardio','cardiovascular system',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','glutes','calves'],'stepmill machine',array['Set the stepmill machine to a comfortable level.','Get onto the machine and place your hands on the handrails for support.','Stand tall with the load secure and the shoulders level.','Walk at a controlled pace, keeping your shoulders level and your steps even.','Keep steps even and avoid leaning away from the load.','Stop before posture breaks down, set the load down safely, and reset for the next walk.'],0),
