('JF8AkMX','Standing Archer','back','upper back',array['deltoids','biceps','forearms'],'bodyweight',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your knees soft.','Reach your arms straight out in front of you at shoulder height, parallel to the ground.','Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.','Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.','Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.','Return through center before turning to the other side.'],0),
