('jgbvVJ0','Dumbbell Incline T-Raise','shoulders','deltoids',array['trapezius','rhomboids'],'dumbbell',array['Angle an incline bench to a 45-degree angle and sit on it with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing inwards.','Tip forward and let your arms hang straight down, perpendicular to the floor.','Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.','Open the arms sideways into a T shape, keeping the torso steady on the bench.','Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.','Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.'],0),
