('jpgqxiS','Cable Standing Crunch','waist','abdominals',array['obliques'],'cable',array['Connect a cable handle to a high pulley and stand turned away from the machine.','Take hold of the handle with both hands and place it behind your head, keeping your elbows bent.','Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.','Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.','Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.','Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.'],0),
