('JZuApnB','Weighted Squat','upper legs','glutes',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves'],'weighted',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, toes pointing slightly outward.','Take a weight ahead of your chest or on your shoulders.','Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.','Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.','Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.','Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.'],0),
