('KI1DjNN','Dumbbell Over Bench Single-Arm Wrist Curl','lower arms','forearms',array['biceps','deltoids'],'dumbbell',array['Plant both feet while seated on a bench; hold a dumbbell in one hand, palm facing down.','Set your forearm on the bench with your wrist hanging off the edge.','Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.','Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.','Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.','Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
