('lFhb2Rw','Smith Front Squat (Clean Grip)','upper legs','glutes',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves','core'],'smith machine',array['Prepare the smith machine with the barbell at shoulder height.','Face the barbell from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Brace before the pull and keep the load close to the body.','Drive through the legs and hips, then guide the weight to its receiving position.','Receive the load with the torso braced and feet stable.','Stand tall to finish, then lower the weight under control before the next rep.'],0),
