('LrV4s90','Cable Wrist Curl','lower arms','forearms',array['biceps','brachialis'],'cable',array['Connect a straight bar to a low pulley cable machine.','Face the machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.','Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.','Use a small, smooth range without swinging the elbows.','Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands.'],0),
('Lsqrgh4','Smith Reverse Calf Raises','lower legs','calves',array['hamstrings'],'smith machine',array['Set the smith machine bar to a height just below your shoulders.','Face the bar with your feet about hip width and toes pointing forward.','Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.','Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.','Pause at the top without rolling the ankles outward.','Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.'],0),
