('MY9P1WA','Smith Decline Reverse-Grip Press','chest','pectorals',array['triceps','deltoids'],'smith machine',array['Set the smith machine to a decline position.','Get onto the bench with your feet secured under the foot pads.','Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.','Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.','Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.','Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.'],0),
