('PERjVm8','Exercise Ball Back Extension with Arms Extended','back','erector spinae',array['glutes','hamstrings'],'stability ball',array['Set the stability ball on the ground and Position yourself face down on top of it, with your hips resting on the ball and your feet against a wall for stability.','Reach your arms straight out in front of you, with your palms facing down.','Secure the hips and feet on the support before lifting.','Raise your torso or legs until they line up with your body, without arching sharply at the lower back.','Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.','Bring the weight or body back to its starting position without rushing.'],0),
