('PkCN2lv','Front Lever','waist','abdominals',array['latissimus dorsi','deltoids','forearms'],'bodyweight',array['Begin by hanging from a pull-up bar with palms facing down, hands about shoulder width.','Brace your trunk and pull your shoulder blades down and back.','Brace the abdomen and find a position you can maintain without holding your breath.','Brace your midsection and hold the position while breathing normally.','Keep breathing steadily as you maintain the same body line.','Keep the shape for the planned time, then come out of it with control.'],0),
