('pwt0pnM','Cable Seated High Row (V-Bar)','back','latissimus dorsi',array['biceps','rhomboids','rear deltoids'],'cable',array['Take a seat on the cable machine with your feet planted and your knees soft.','Hold the v-bar attachment with palms facing down, palms facing each other, and your hands about shoulder width.','Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.','Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.','Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.','Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.'],0),
