('PXTIwgu','Arm Slingers Hanging Straight-Legs','waist','abdominals',array['deltoids','back'],'bodyweight',array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your arms straight and your legs straight down.','Brace your trunk and lift your legs up in front of you until they are parallel to the ground.','Brace the abdomen and keep the shoulders anchored to the support.','Lift your legs by bracing your trunk and moving at the hips rather than swinging.','Slow the legs before they pull the lower back out of position.','Lower the legs slowly without swinging or losing your trunk position.'],0),
('py1HSzx','Barbell Lateral Lunge','upper legs','glutes',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves'],'barbell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a barbell across your upper back.','Step wide to the side with your right foot, keeping your left foot planted.','Set your stance wide enough to balance before bending either knee.','Step into the movement and bend both knees, keeping your front foot planted.','Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.','Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.'],0),
('PzNxakt','Calf Push Stretch with Hands Against Wall','lower legs','calves',array['hamstrings'],'bodyweight',array['Face a wall with your feet about hip width.','Set your hands against the wall at shoulder height.','Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.','Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.','Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.','Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.'],0),
('PzQanLE','Cable Shoulder Press','shoulders','deltoids',array['triceps','upper back'],'cable',array['Set the cable machine so that the handles are at shoulder height.','Face the away from the machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.','Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.','Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.','Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.'],0),
('pZwUsKB','Iron Cross Stretch','upper legs','glutes',array['hamstrings','quadriceps'],'bodyweight',array['Settle onto your back with your arms extended out to the sides.','Raise your legs up toward the ceiling, keeping them straight.','Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.','Open the arms out to the sides to form a T, then bring them back under control.','Stop near shoulder height rather than shrugging to lift higher.','Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.'],0),
('q2ADGqV','Cable Side Crunch','waist','abdominals',array['obliques'],'cable',array['Connect a cable handle to a low pulley and stand sideways to the machine.','Hold the handle with the hand furthest from the machine and place your other hand on your hip.','Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.','Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.','Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.','Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.'],0),
('Q2Eu1Ax','Cable Lying Extension Pullover (With Rope Attachment)','back','latissimus dorsi',array['triceps','deltoids'],'cable',array['Connect a rope to a cable machine and set the pulley at the highest position.','Get onto a bench with your head toward the cable machine.','Set the ribs down and keep a small elbow bend before lowering the weight.','Lower the weight in an arc behind your head until you feel a comfortable shoulder stretch.','Keep the ribs down as the arms travel overhead.','Pull the weight back over the chest along the same arc, without lifting the ribs.'],0),
('Q497lAE','Drop Push Up','chest','pectorals',array['triceps','deltoids'],'bodyweight',array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands just beyond shoulder width.','Lower your chest toward the ground, keeping your elbows close to your body.','Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.','Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.','Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.','Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.'],0),
('Q4DSJPC','Smith Single-Arm Row','back','upper back',array['biceps','forearms'],'smith machine',array['Set the height of the smith machine bar to waist level.','Face the smith machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.','Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.','Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.','Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
('Q6bvyen','Hanging Straight Twisting Leg Hip Raise','waist','abdominals',array['obliques','hip flexors'],'bodyweight',array['Suspend yourself from a pull-up bar with your arms straight and your legs straight.','Brace your trunk and lift your legs up toward your chest, keeping them straight.','Plant the feet and keep the ribs from flaring as the hips prepare to rise.','Press through the feet and lift your hips until your torso and thighs line up.','Stop when the hips line up with the torso; do not arch higher through the lower back.','Lower the hips steadily and keep the feet planted for the next lift.'],0),
('q6y3OhV','Machine Biceps Curl','upper arms','biceps',array['forearms'],'leverage machine',array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.','Hold the handles with palms facing up, and Keep your elbows near your ribs.','Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.','Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.','Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.','Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.'],0),
('q7qkONO','Alternating Seated Dumbbell Shoulder Press','shoulders','deltoids',array['triceps','upper back'],'dumbbell',array['Take a seat on a bench with your back straight and feet planted.','Take a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing inwards, and raise them to shoulder height.','Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.','Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.','Finish one side''s motion before the other side takes over.','Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
('q8aHNoF','Dumbbell Single-Arm Wrist Curl','lower arms','forearms',array['biceps','brachialis'],'dumbbell',array['Take a seat on a bench or chair with your feet planted.','Take a dumbbell in one hand with palms facing up, resting your forearm on your thigh.','Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.','Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.','Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.','Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
('Qa55kX1','Sled Hack Squat','upper legs','glutes',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves'],'sled machine',array['Set the sled machine to a comfortable position for your height.','Stand and set your feet about shoulder width on the platform, toes slightly pointed outwards.','Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.','Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.','Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.','Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.'],0),
