('S37C94C','Kettlebell Single-Arm Jerk','shoulders','deltoids',array['triceps','core'],'kettlebell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a kettlebell in one hand at shoulder height.','Bend your knees slightly and Brace your trunk.','Brace before the pull and keep the load close to the body.','Drive through the legs and hips, then guide the weight to its receiving position.','Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.','Stand tall to finish, then lower the weight under control before the next rep; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
