('s5PdDyY','Dumbbell Tate Press','upper arms','triceps',array['deltoids'],'dumbbell',array['Take a seat on a flat bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing each other.','Raise the dumbbells to shoulder height, then rotate your wrists so that your palms are turned away from you.','Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.','Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.','Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.','Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.'],0),
('s7HX1BY','Barbell Wide Squat','upper legs','quadriceps',array['glutes','hamstrings','calves'],'barbell',array['Stand and set your feet wider than about shoulder width, toes pointing slightly outward.','Rest the bar across the upper back and take a secure grip.','Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.','Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.','Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.','Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.'],0),
