('s999Hdo','Dumbbell Single-Arm Seated Biceps Curl on Exercise Ball','upper arms','biceps',array['forearms'],'dumbbell',array['Take a seat on an exercise ball with your feet planted and your back straight.','Take a dumbbell in one hand with your palm facing up and your arm straight.','Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.','Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.','Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.','Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
