('SJAA2IQ','Barbell Palms Up Wrist Curl Over a Bench','lower arms','forearms',array['biceps','deltoids'],'barbell',array['Plant both feet while seated on a bench; hold a barbell with palms facing up.','Support the forearms on the bench while leaving the wrists free beyond its edge.','Keep the elbows relaxed so the small muscles of the hand or forearm take the load.','Move through the wrists or fingers while the forearms stay supported and still.','Use a small, smooth range without swinging the elbows.','Ease back to the start without letting the load fall from your hands.'],0),
('sJFIDIp','Biceps Leg Concentration Curl','upper arms','biceps',array['forearms'],'bodyweight',array['Take a seat on a bench with your legs spread apart and your feet planted.','Take a dumbbell in one hand and place your elbow on the inside of your thigh, just above the knee.','Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.','Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.','Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.','Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.'],0),
('SJqRxOt','Cable Rope Seated Row','back','upper back',array['biceps','forearms'],'cable',array['Take a seat on the rowing machine with your feet flat on the footrests and knees soft.','Hold the cable ropes with palms facing down, palms facing each other.','Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.','Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.','Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.','Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.'],0),
('SKXQAx3','Roller Reverse Crunch','waist','abdominals',array['hip flexors'],'roller',array['Settle onto your back with your arms extended straight above your head and your legs straight out in front of you.','Set the roller between your feet and grip it with your toes.','Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.','Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.','Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.','Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.'],0),
('SLKj2pX','Cocoons','waist','abdominals',array['hip flexors','erector spinae'],'bodyweight',array['Settle onto your back with your knees bent and feet planted.','Set your hands behind your head with your elbows pointing outwards.','Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.','Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.','Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.','Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.'],0),
('sM84pE4','Exercise Ball Lat Stretch','back','latissimus dorsi',array['deltoids','triceps'],'stability ball',array['Take a seat on a stability ball with your feet planted and your back straight.','Take a dumbbell in one hand and extend your arm straight up overhead.','Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.','Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.','Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.','Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.'],0),
('Sn8wxAI','Crunch (On Stability Ball, Arms Straight)','waist','abdominals',array['hip flexors'],'stability ball',array['Take a seat on the stability ball with your feet planted and your knees bent at a 90-degree angle.','Recline on the ball until your lower back is supported and your upper body is parallel to the floor.','Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.','Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.','Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.','Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.'],0),
('SNFfUff','Barbell Lying Lifting (On Hip)','upper legs','glutes',array['hamstrings','quadriceps'],'barbell',array['Settle onto your back on a bench with your feet planted and your knees bent.','Take hold of the barbell with palms facing down and position it on your hips.','Plant the feet and keep the ribs from flaring as the hips prepare to rise.','Press through the feet and lift your hips until your torso and thighs line up.','Stop when the hips line up with the torso; do not arch higher through the lower back.','Lower the hips steadily and keep the feet planted for the next lift.'],0),
('Snj1wSv','Plyo Push Up','chest','pectorals',array['triceps','deltoids','core'],'bodyweight',array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands just beyond shoulder width.','Lower your chest toward the ground by bending your elbows, keeping your body in a straight line.','Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.','Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.','Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.','Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.'],0),
('soIB2rj','Diamond Push-Up','upper arms','triceps',array['pectorals','deltoids'],'bodyweight',array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands close together, forming a diamond shape with your thumbs and index fingers.','Hold your body in a straight line from head to toe, engaging your core and glutes.','Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.','Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.','Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.','Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.'],0),
('SP3hUez','Swimmer Kicks','upper legs','glutes',array['hamstrings','quadriceps','calves'],'bodyweight',array['Position yourself face down on a mat with your arms extended overhead.','Brace your trunk and lift your chest and legs off the ground simultaneously.','Brace the trunk lightly before moving a limb.','Move the working arm or leg while keeping the trunk steady and the breathing even.','Keep the pelvis from rocking as the arm or leg moves.','Reset your posture before changing sides or beginning the next rep.'],0),
('SpsOSXk','Cable Rear Pulldown','back','latissimus dorsi',array['biceps','rhomboids','rear deltoids'],'cable',array['Set the cable machine so that the pulley is at the highest position.','Sit facing the machine with your feet planted and your knees soft.','Sit tall and set the shoulders before drawing the handle down.','Pull the handle down by driving your elbows toward your ribs; keep your torso steady.','Pull with the elbows rather than leaning far back to move the handle.','Let the handle rise steadily until the arms are long, then reset the shoulders.'],0),
('SpYC0Kp','Dumbbell Bench Press','chest','pectorals',array['triceps','deltoids'],'dumbbell',array['Settle onto a bench with your feet planted and your back pressed against the bench.','Take a dumbbell in each hand, with your palms facing forward and your arms extended above your chest.','Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.','Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.','Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.','Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.'],32),
('SSsBDwB','Dumbbell Rear Lunge','upper legs','glutes',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves'],'dumbbell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a dumbbell in each hand.','Step backward with your right foot, lowering your body into a lunge position.','Set your stance wide enough to balance before bending either knee.','Step into the movement and bend both knees, keeping your front foot planted.','Keep the front foot planted and avoid collapsing inward at the knee.','Push through the lead foot to return to the start, then change legs as planned.'],0),
('sTfvVsG','Band Reverse Fly','shoulders','deltoids',array['upper back','trapezius'],'resistance band',array['Connect the band to a stationary object at chest height.','Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold the band with both hands in front of you.','Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.','Open your arms out and back with a slight elbow bend, drawing the shoulder blades together.','Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.','Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.'],0),
('sTg7iys','Band Front Lateral Raise','shoulders','deltoids',array['trapezius','upper back'],'resistance band',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold the band ahead of your thighs with your palms facing down.','Maintain straight arms and lift the band up in front of you until your arms are parallel to the ground.','Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.','Raise the arms out to the sides to about shoulder height without leaning or shrugging.','Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.','Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight.'],0),
('sU5BrfP','Leg Up Hamstring Stretch','upper legs','hamstrings',array['glutes'],'bodyweight',array['Settle onto your back with your legs extended.','Bend one knee and bring it toward your chest, holding onto your thigh or shin.','Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.','Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.','Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.','Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.'],0),
