('vptOQ4N','Deep Push Up','chest','pectorals',array['triceps','deltoids'],'dumbbell',array['Begin in a high plank position with your hands just beyond shoulder width and your body in a straight line.','Lower your chest toward the ground by bending your elbows, keeping them close to your body.','Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.','Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.','Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.','Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.'],0),
