('wVompEp','Push Up on Bosu Ball','chest','pectorals',array['triceps','deltoids','core'],'bosu ball',array['Set the bosu ball on the ground with the flat side facing up.','Set yourself in a push-up position with your hands on the outer edges of the bosu ball.','Brace the abdomen and glutes so the shoulders, hips and ankles move together.','Bend your elbows to lower your chest while keeping your body in one line.','Keep the head in line with the spine as the elbows bend.','Press back to straight arms, keeping the body line intact.'],0),
