('XsCcxCC','Machine Seated Good Morning','upper legs','glutes',array['hamstrings','erector spinae'],'leverage machine',array['Set the seat height so that your hips are slightly higher than your knees.','Take a seat on the machine with your back against the pad and your feet flat on the footrests.','Unlock the knees and brace the abdomen before moving the hips back.','Push the hips back while keeping the load close and the spine steady.','Keep the weight close to the legs and stop when the back would begin to round.','Drive the hips forward to stand tall without leaning back at the top.'],0),
('XSCHmiI','Cycle Cross Trainer','cardio','cardiovascular system',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','glutes'],'leverage machine',array['Fit the seat to your body, then settle into the machine.','Set your feet on the pedals and grip the handlebars.','Start at a pace that lets the feet and arms move in sync.','Move at a repeatable pace, keeping the motion smooth and your breathing steady.','Keep the pattern repeatable as speed increases.','Keep the rhythm for the planned interval, slowing if your form starts to slip.'],0),
('xTjr103','Standing Hamstring and Calf Stretch with Strap','upper legs','hamstrings',array['calves'],'rope',array['Stand upright with your feet about shoulder width.','Take hold of the strap with both hands and place it around the ball of your foot.','Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.','Ease the heel down and shift until the calf stretches; keep the foot pointed ahead.','Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.','Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.'],0),
('XU3ePuv','Cable Standing Crunch (With Rope Attachment)','waist','abdominals',array['obliques'],'cable',array['Connect a rope to a cable machine at chest height.','Face the away from the machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.','Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.','Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.','Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.'],0),
('XUUD0Fs','Dumbbell Lying Rear Delt Row','back','upper back',array['deltoids','biceps'],'dumbbell',array['Position yourself face down on a flat bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing inwards.','Extend your arms straight down toward the floor, keeping a slight bend in your elbows.','Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.','Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.','Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.','Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.'],0),
('xUwnBMT','Smith Seated Shoulder Press','shoulders','deltoids',array['triceps','upper back'],'smith machine',array['Set the seat height so that the handles are at shoulder level.','Take a seat on the machine with your back against the pad and your feet planted.','Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.','Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.','Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.','Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.'],0),
('XVDdcoj','Russian Twist','waist','abdominals',array['obliques'],'bodyweight',array['Take a seat on the ground with your knees bent and feet planted.','Lean back slightly while with your spine steady and your core engaged.','Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.','Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.','Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.','Return through center before turning to the other side.'],0),
('XVzF3iZ','Dumbbell Lying Supine Biceps Curl','upper arms','biceps',array['forearms'],'dumbbell',array['Settle onto a bench with your back and head supported, and your feet planted.','Take a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing up and your arms straight.','Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.','Bend your elbows to bring the weight toward your shoulders without swinging your torso.','Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.','Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.'],0),
('xXm4nYq','Dumbbell Decline Fly','chest','pectorals',array['deltoids'],'dumbbell',array['Secure the feet on a decline bench, keeping the head below the hips.','Take a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing each other and your arms extended above your chest.','Keep a soft elbow bend and set the shoulders before moving the arms.','With a soft bend in the elbows, sweep your arms together in a wide arc.','Keep the elbow angle nearly unchanged through the arc.','Open the arms back along the same arc without dropping the load.'],0),
('Y1MsI1l','Band Leg Extension','upper legs','quadriceps',array['hamstrings'],'resistance band',array['Connect the resistance band to a sturdy anchor point and secure it around your ankle.','Face the anchor point from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Set the pad just above the ankles and keep the thighs against the seat.','Straighten your knees to lift the pad, keeping your hips against the seat.','Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.','Return along the same path at a controlled pace.'],0),
('Y4QlY8z','Smith Toe Raise','lower legs','calves',array['ankles','tibialis anterior'],'smith machine',array['Set the smith machine bar to a height that allows you to comfortably stand with your feet planted.','Set yourself under the bar with your shoulders directly below it and your feet about shoulder width.','Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.','Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.','Pause at the top without rolling the ankles outward.','Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.'],0),
('y5p0H8a','Run (Equipment)','cardio','cardiovascular system',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves'],'bodyweight',array['Begin by standing upright with your feet about hip width.','Brace your trunk and keep your upper body relaxed.','Start at a pace that lets the feet and arms move in sync.','Move at a repeatable pace, keeping the motion smooth and your breathing steady.','Keep the pattern repeatable as speed increases.','Keep the rhythm for the planned interval, slowing if your form starts to slip.'],0),
('y5U5B9Y','Dumbbell Zottman Preacher Curl','upper arms','biceps',array['forearms'],'dumbbell',array['Take a seat on a preacher bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing up and elbows resting on the pad.','Curl the dumbbells up toward your shoulders, With the upper arms still and your palms facing up.','Set the working upper arm against the preacher pad and leave the elbow free to bend.','Curl palms-up, turn the palms down at the top, and lower with that overhand grip.','Keep the torso quiet and let the elbow bend lift the weight.','Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.'],0),
('Y5X65IB','Ez-Bar Reverse-Grip Curl','upper arms','biceps',array['forearms'],'EZ bar',array['Stand tall with your feet about shoulder width and hold the ez barbell with palms facing up.','Hold your elbows near your torso and your upper arms stationary throughout the exercise.','Set the shoulders and upper arms before bending the elbows.','Curl the weight with your palms facing down, keeping the elbows close and torso still.','Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.','Lower until the elbows are nearly straight, keeping the upper arms still.'],0),
('Y7YcmIJ','Barbell Bench Front Squat','upper legs','quadriceps',array['hamstrings','glutes','calves'],'barbell',array['Begin by standing with your feet about shoulder width and the barbell resting on your upper chest, just below your collarbone.','Take hold of the barbell with palms facing down, keeping your elbows up and your upper arms parallel to the ground.','Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.','Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.','Drive upward with the chest and hips rising together; keep the knees from collapsing inward.','Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.'],0),
('y8bYM8w','Band Single Leg Split Squat','upper legs','quadriceps',array['glutes','hamstrings'],'resistance band',array['Stand and set your feet about hip width and place a resistance band around your ankles.','Step wide forward with your right foot and a smaller step back with your left foot.','Brace the abdomen and spread pressure across the whole foot.','Bend at the hips and knees to lower, keeping your feet grounded and knees tracking with the toes.','Control the band on the way back instead of letting it snap you into position.','Stand fully, reset your footing and breathing, then begin the next descent.'],0),
('Y9hNPcN','Seated Side Crunch (Wall)','waist','abdominals',array['obliques'],'bodyweight',array['Take a seat on the floor with your back against a wall and your legs extended in front of you.','Bend your knees and place your feet planted, about hip width.','Set the pelvis and keep the neck relaxed before curling upward.','Curl your rib cage toward your pelvis, letting the abdominals move the torso.','Leave a little space between the chin and chest; keep the movement in the torso.','Lower the shoulders or torso with control before the next curl.'],0),
('yaAxcQr','Rope Climb','back','upper back',array['forearms','biceps','deltoids'],'rope',array['Face the rope from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Take hold of the rope with both hands, palms facing toward you.','Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.','Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.','Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.','Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.'],0),
('YAk5dIw','Reverse-Grip Pull-Up','back','latissimus dorsi',array['biceps','forearms'],'bodyweight',array['Take hold of the pull-up bar with palms facing up, hands about shoulder width.','Suspend yourself from the bar with your arms straight and your body straight.','Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.','Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.','Keep the palms in the chosen grip without bending the wrists back.','Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.'],0),
('yaMIo4D','Cable Incline Bench Row','back','upper back',array['biceps','rear deltoids'],'cable',array['Prepare an incline bench at a 45-degree angle and attach a cable handle to the low pulley.','Take a seat on the bench facing the cable machine with your feet planted and your knees soft.','Set the torso and allow the arms to reach forward without rounding excessively.','Draw your elbows back and bring the handle or weight toward your torso.','Bring the elbows back without jerking the torso.','Reach the arms forward again without letting the torso lurch.'],0),
('yB9SvIF','Smith Machine Decline Close-Grip Bench Press','upper arms','triceps',array['pectorals','deltoids'],'smith machine',array['Set the bench on the smith machine to a decline position.','Get onto the bench with your feet firmly planted on the ground.','Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.','Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.','Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.','Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.'],0),
('yCvYdi7','Kettlebell Single-Arm Military Press to the Side','shoulders','deltoids',array['triceps','core'],'kettlebell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width, holding a kettlebell in one hand at shoulder height.','Brace your trunk and Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position.','Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.','Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.','Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.','Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
('Yg7MJAT','Dumbbell Single-Arm Lateral Raise with Support','shoulders','deltoids',array['trapezius','rotator cuff'],'dumbbell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold a dumbbell in one hand, with your palm facing your body.','Set your other hand on a stable surface, such as a bench or wall, for support.','Start with a manageable load and a small bend in the elbows.','Raise the arms out to the sides to about shoulder height without leaning or shrugging.','Keep both shoulders level and resist turning toward the working arm.','Lower the arms slowly to your sides without swinging the weight; switch sides when the set calls for it.'],0),
('yg8Totb','Barbell Lying Back of the Head Triceps Extension','upper arms','triceps',array['deltoids'],'barbell',array['Settle onto a bench with your feet planted and your head at the end of the bench.','Take a barbell with palms facing down, hands about shoulder width, and extend your arms straight up over your chest.','Set the upper arms in place before extending the elbows.','Keep the upper arms steady and extend through the elbows to move the weight.','Keep the upper arms steady while the forearms travel.','Bend the elbows slowly to return to the start of the next rep.'],0),
('yJUHKTn','Muscle Up','back','latissimus dorsi',array['biceps','triceps','deltoids','pectorals'],'bodyweight',array['Begin by hanging from a pull-up bar with your palms turned away from you and your arms straight.','Brace your trunk and pull your body up toward the bar, leading with your chest.','Begin from a controlled hang with the shoulders active rather than slack.','Pull your elbows down and bring your upper chest toward the bar without kicking your legs.','Avoid swinging the legs to clear the bar.','Lower to long arms without dropping suddenly from the top.'],0),
('ykA5tU7','Chest Stretch with Exercise Ball','chest','pectorals',array['deltoids','triceps'],'stability ball',array['Take a seat on the stability ball with your feet planted and your back straight.','Take hold of the exercise ball with both hands and extend your arms straight out in front of you.','Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.','Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.','Keep the ball steady and use the feet to manage your balance.','Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.'],0),
