('ykUOVze','Machine Standing Calf Raise','lower legs','calves',array['soleus','ankle stabilizers'],'leverage machine',array['Set the machine to your height and stand with your feet about shoulder width.','Set your shoulders under the pads and hold onto the handles for stability.','Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.','Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.','Pause at the top without rolling the ankles outward.','Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.'],14),
('yl2IYyy','Cable Standing Calf Raise','lower legs','calves',array['hamstrings','glutes'],'cable',array['Face the cable machine from a stable stance with feet about shoulder width.','Use the cable machine handles or attach a cable ankle strap to your ankles.','Let the ankles move freely while the rest of the body stays quiet.','Rise through the balls of your feet, lifting the heels as high as you can without rocking.','Pause at the top without rolling the ankles outward.','Lower the heels at a measured pace before rising again.'],0),
