('yn2lLSI','Sled 45° Leg Press (Back Pov)','upper legs','glutes',array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves'],'sled machine',array['Set the seat of the sled machine so that your knees are at a 45-degree angle.','Take a seat on the sled machine with your back against the backrest and your feet about shoulder width on the footplate.','Set your feet firmly on the plate and keep the hips against the seat.','Bend the knees to bring the platform toward you, then press it away through the feet.','Stop the descent before the hips lift from the seat.','Ease back to the start before repeating.'],0),
