('yq3GAJX','Hands Reversed Clasped Circular Toe Touch','upper legs','glutes',array['hamstrings','quadriceps','calves'],'bodyweight',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and your arms extended to the sides.','Bend forward at the waist, with your spine steady and your knees soft.','Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.','Fold forward from the hips and let your hands travel toward your feet without forcing the reach.','Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.','Hold briefly at a comfortable depth, then rise by extending the hips.'],0),
('yQe5HpE','Barbell Standing Twist','waist','abdominals',array['obliques','erector spinae'],'barbell',array['Stand and set your feet about shoulder width and hold a barbell ahead of your chest with both hands, palms facing down.','Brace your trunk and Keep your spine in a comfortable neutral position throughout the exercise.','Set the pelvis and make the turn through the rib cage.','Turn through the torso while the hips and lower body stay as steady as the setup allows.','Keep the turn smooth instead of throwing the arms across the body.','Return through center before turning to the other side.'],0),
('YqJw82s','Barbell Reverse Close-Grip Bench Press','upper arms','triceps',array['pectorals','deltoids'],'barbell',array['Settle onto a bench with your feet planted and your back pressed against the bench.','Hold the barbell with a reverse grip, hands about shoulder width.','Brace the torso and align the wrists with the forearms.','Press the weight or handles away while keeping your trunk braced.','Keep the wrists stacked and use a shoulder path that feels natural.','Lower the weight to its starting height under control before pressing again.'],0),
