('Z5YStHW','Overhead Triceps Stretch','upper arms','triceps',array['deltoids'],'bodyweight',array['Either stand or sit upright with your feet about shoulder width.','Extend one arm overhead, bending at the elbow so that your hand reaches toward the opposite shoulder blade.','Settle into the starting position and take an easy breath before moving deeper.','Ease toward the stretch until you feel mild tension; keep breathing and avoid bouncing.','Stay in a mild stretch rather than pulling farther with momentum.','Hold the position with steady breathing, then release gently; repeat on the other side if needed.'],0),
